{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.poster.avif?t=1758728445\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.webm?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.mp4?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cozy and lively island life! Here, your pets aren\u2019t just simple NPCs\u2014they have rich emotions, unique personalities, and memories. They\u2019ll actively play with you, and might even throw a little tantrum now and then!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong> to get the earliest updates and release notifications!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adorable Companions to Soothe Your Heart!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build genuine, lasting friendships with your intriguing cats. Through everyday interactions\u2014chatting, playing, and feeding\u2014get to know each feline, raise your bond level, and enjoy a nurturing journey that\u2019s warm and full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.poster.avif?t=1758728445\" width=752 height=726 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.webm?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.mp4?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover New Species and Become a Fishing Master!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all kinds of fish to complete the full Fishdex\u2014from common  to rare species, all waiting in your net! Grip your rod; with patience and a bit of luck, you might even reel in a legendary creature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.poster.avif?t=1758728445\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.webm?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.mp4?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.poster.avif?t=1758728445\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.webm?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.mp4?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brick by Brick, Build Your Dream Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy tons of customization options\u2014from your character to your pets, from interior d\u00e9cor to outdoor landscapes. From tranquil lakes to bustling harbors\u2026 craft your very own paradise, step by step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.poster.avif?t=1758728445\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.webm?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.mp4?t=1758728445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Online with Your Friends and Create Memorable Moments!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer is supported. Invite friends to your island to fish together, swap raising tips, join party events\u2026 and create unique memories together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t forget to <strong>WISHLIST NOW\u00a0</strong>\u2014we look forward to meeting you!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743680?t=1758728445","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/760412d3d9562e75e787b0605cd45bc073d59374/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758728445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/a8cf979179b1cfb930cc1eb527ab5c2bed32002c/capsule_23